      "persona": "Universal Persona Content",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Dr. Mira Sen:</b> The banner is evidence, not public relations copy. Ilya will want it softened before launch, Kade would treat it as a target profile, and Lena will want a version the public can understand safely. Whatever kind of record you are building, it gets settled now, while it is still yours to write.",
      "taskInstructions": "",
      "taskQuestion": "",
      "taskCompleteText": "<b>Dr. Mira Sen:</b> Decide how you will preserve and communicate the banner evidence."
    }
